"            <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">\n"
"                <font class=\"text-o-color-2\">have invited someone or been "
"invited to</font>\n"
"            </span>\n"
"        </span>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"            <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">\n"
"                <font class=\"text-o-color-2\">Sdílené</font>\n"
"            </span>\n"
"        </span>\n"
"        <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"            — To jsou ty, na které jste\n"
"            <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">\n"
"                <font class=\"text-o-color-2\">někoho pozvali nebo ke kterým "
