"<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">From any Odoo document, find this article "
"by clicking on the 📗 icon in the chatter.</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Tento článek najdete v jakýmkoliv dokumentu "
